%% Imzo: device lifecycle on the server.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PendingConfirm: enrolment answer verified
  PendingConfirm --> Active: codes match, administrator activates
  PendingConfirm --> Revoked: codes differ
  Active --> Locked: five failed verifications in a row
  Locked --> Active: administrator unlocks
  Active --> Revoked: lost, stolen or retired
  Locked --> Revoked: administrator revokes
  Revoked --> [*]
